Bind Npc 31564 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31563 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 660 "Start Trading"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Trader] Drill."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Trader] Ellon."

Requires player level >= 67 and quest 659 is completed

Rewards
    Give 1 of 900194000

On available
    Say "All searches are finally done. [Merchant] Drill has something to say to you. Please go meet him."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Oh, you are here. The captain was right about you. You've been a great help."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now there's only one last trade to make.\n\nDo you, by chance, know Kaishan, the [Merchant Prince] of Moradon? We are making a trade with him this time. I need you to do this because I heard that you have a close relationship with him, <selfname>.\n\nThe Eslant updated traders will need to drill and conversation."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Oh, you are here. The captain was right about you. You've been a great help."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now there's only one last trade to make.\n\nDo you, by chance, know Kaishan, the [Merchant Prince] of Moradon? We are making a trade with him this time. I need you to do this because I heard that you have a close relationship with him, <selfname>.\n\nEslant updated traders should be a conversation with Ellen."

On claimable
    Show quest "All items are ready. You collected them and had them appraised. I know you, <selfname>, will explain them well."
